  "description": "*\"I want to be your secretary, sir.\"\n\n\"You want to choose? One, sell your organs. Two, go to people who might like the baby. Three, be my secretary.\" \n\n* What emerged from the man's arms was a \"joint guarantee\" document that would send Lee Hae-Na to hell. Alcoholism, domestic violence, neglect. Now it was a guarantee. Lee Hae-Na had only one choice: become the secretary of the man in front of her, Choi Tae-Geon. The man gave a sly smile at Lee Hae-Na's answer. She felt trapped, trapped.\n\n *\"Have you ever slept with a man?\"*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Sunjeong Danpyeonseon (순정 단편선) Collection.*",
